#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: checkoff.php
msgid "CheckOff"
msgstr "CheckOff"

#. Description of the plugin
#: checkoff.php
msgid "Let visitors build their own multi-level checklists from building blocks — simple lists, weekday lists, colour and number ratings, counters and notes — and tick them off."
msgstr "Besucher stellen sich aus Bausteinen eigene, mehrstufige Checklisten zusammen – einfache Listen, Wochentagslisten, Farb- und Zahlenbewertungen, Zähler und Notizen – und haken sie ab."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:112
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allgemein"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:113
msgid "Where checklists are shown and who may create them."
msgstr "Wo Checklisten angezeigt werden und wer sie anlegen darf."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:117
msgid "Checklist page"
msgstr "Checklisten-Seite"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:118
msgid "The page that contains the [cko_app] or [cko_checklist] shortcode. Links to checklists and the \"Open\" form lead there. Without one, they lead to the page the form is on."
msgstr "Die Seite mit dem Shortcode [cko_app] oder [cko_checklist]. Links zu Checklisten und das Formular „Öffnen“ führen dorthin. Ohne Auswahl führen sie zu der Seite, auf der das Formular steht."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:125
msgid "Guests may create checklists"
msgstr "Gäste dürfen Checklisten anlegen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:126
msgid "Off: only logged-in users can create checklists. Opening and ticking existing checklists by their ID is always possible."
msgstr "Aus: Nur angemeldete Benutzer können Checklisten anlegen. Bestehende Checklisten per ID öffnen und abhaken ist immer möglich."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:133
msgid "Length of new IDs"
msgstr "Länge neuer IDs"

#. translators: 1: minimum, 2: maximum.
#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:136
#, php-format
msgid "Characters, %1$s to %2$s. Longer IDs are harder to guess and harder to type. Existing IDs keep their length."
msgstr "Zeichen, %1$s bis %2$s. Längere IDs sind schwerer zu erraten und schwerer abzutippen. Bestehende IDs behalten ihre Länge."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:150
msgid "Building blocks"
msgstr "Bausteine"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:151
msgid "Which building blocks visitors can use, and how the ratings look. A block that is switched off is no longer offered; checklists already using it keep working."
msgstr "Welche Bausteine Besucher verwenden können und wie die Bewertungen aussehen. Ein abgeschalteter Baustein wird nicht mehr angeboten; Checklisten, die ihn schon verwenden, funktionieren weiter."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:156
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Grenzen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:157
msgid "Protect the site against oversized checklists and misuse."
msgstr "Schützt die Website vor übergroßen Checklisten und Missbrauch."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:161
msgid "Nesting depth"
msgstr "Verschachtelungstiefe"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:162
msgid "How many levels a checklist may have, the top level included."
msgstr "Wie viele Ebenen eine Checkliste haben darf, die oberste mitgezählt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:171
msgid "Maximum size"
msgstr "Maximale Größe"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:172
msgid "How many entries and sub-lists one checklist may contain in total."
msgstr "Wie viele Einträge und Unterlisten eine Checkliste insgesamt enthalten darf."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:181
msgid "New checklists per hour"
msgstr "Neue Checklisten pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:182
msgid "Per visitor. 0 = unlimited."
msgstr "Pro Besucher. 0 = unbegrenzt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:191
msgid "Unknown IDs per hour"
msgstr "Unbekannte IDs pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:192
msgid "Per visitor. After this many attempts with IDs that do not exist, opening checklists is blocked for an hour, so IDs cannot be guessed by trying. 0 = unlimited (not recommended)."
msgstr "Pro Besucher. Nach so vielen Versuchen mit IDs, die es nicht gibt, ist das Öffnen von Checklisten für eine Stunde gesperrt – so lassen sich IDs nicht durch Ausprobieren erraten. 0 = unbegrenzt (nicht empfohlen)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:203
msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "Wartung"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:204
msgid "Cleanup and uninstall."
msgstr "Aufräumen und Deinstallation."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:208
msgid "Delete unused checklists"
msgstr "Unbenutzte Checklisten löschen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:209
msgid "Days without being opened after which a checklist is deleted automatically (checked once a day). 0 = never."
msgstr "Tage ohne Aufruf, nach denen eine Checkliste automatisch gelöscht wird (einmal täglich geprüft). 0 = nie."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:218
msgid "Delete checklists on uninstall"
msgstr "Checklisten bei Deinstallation löschen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:219
msgid "When the plugin is deleted, also delete all checklists. Settings are always removed."
msgstr "Beim Löschen des Plugins auch alle Checklisten löschen. Die Einstellungen werden immer entfernt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:247
msgid "Available building blocks"
msgstr "Verfügbare Bausteine"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:259
msgid "Always available, as every checklist is built on it."
msgstr "Immer verfügbar, weil jede Checkliste darauf aufbaut."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:271
msgid "Colour scale"
msgstr "Farbskala"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:272
msgid "Five steps from lowest to highest. A scale with three colours uses the first, the middle and the last step."
msgstr "Fünf Stufen von der niedrigsten zur höchsten. Eine Skala mit drei Farben verwendet die erste, die mittlere und die letzte Stufe."

#. translators: %s: step number.
#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:283
#, php-format
msgid "Step %s"
msgstr "Stufe %s"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:298 includes/lib/blocks/class-checkoff-block-number-scale.php:36
msgid "Rating with numbers"
msgstr "Bewertung mit Zahlen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:303
msgid "Default from"
msgstr "Standard von"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:304
msgid "Lowest number of a new rating block. Visitors can change it per block."
msgstr "Niedrigste Zahl eines neuen Bewertungsbausteins. Besucher können sie je Baustein ändern."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:314
msgid "Default to"
msgstr "Standard bis"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:315
msgid "Highest number of a new rating block."
msgstr "Höchste Zahl eines neuen Bewertungsbausteins."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:378 includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:564
msgid "CheckOff Settings"
msgstr "CheckOff-Einstellungen"

